      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“赛马娘们正是为此走上这条路。\n过去、现在──和未来的三冠赛马娘皆如此。”\n采访人、编辑：乙名史悦子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e22f496f7293eb3055bfa126ce48b7a69e455c6eebbe1504e38eb8331d8e2f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
